<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index fell 0.69 to 637.34.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.07.</p>
<p>Advancers beat decliners 317 to 267.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 26,553,000 compared with 27,721,760 on Wednesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EDT/2030 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
</text>
